                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='22060' id='32' type-v2='text' w='98968' x='516' y='18867'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='15'>LEGEND</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;DF&quot; = </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759'>Delivery Fee</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>; &quot;GFV&quot; = </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e15759'>Gross Food Value</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>; &quot;GMV&quot; = </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e15759'>Gross Merchandise Value</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>; &quot;JF&quot; = </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e15759'>Joker Vendor Fee</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>; &quot;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>SOF&quot; = </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e15759'>Small Order Fee</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>; &quot;SF&quot; = </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e15759'>Service Fee</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>; </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;GP&quot; </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>= </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e15759'>Gross Profit</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='15'>Instructions:</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>1- If the switchback test is </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>with interleaving</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>,  make sure you select the correct zones from the filters &quot;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Zone Name Vendor&quot; </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>and </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;Zone Name Customer&quot;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>. </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Case in Point: </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>PH_20220721_R_F0_O_SB_AA_Test_Calamba_No_Condition has two interleaving zones (</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Canlubang </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>and </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Cabuyao</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>), thus we pick </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;Cabuyao&quot;, &quot;Canlubang&quot;, </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>and</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'> &quot;Cabuyao, Calamba&quot; </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e15759' italic='true'>(these two zones partially overlap)  </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>from </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;Zone Name Vendor&quot; </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>and exclude &quot;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Calamba&quot; </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>from </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;Zone Name Customer&quot;</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>2- Mandatory filters to pull the right data --&gt; </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>All </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>except </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;Even/Odd Day&quot; </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>and </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;Dow Local&quot;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>. Make sure to check the experiment&apos;s setup and select the correct scheme IDs that represent the &apos;ON&apos; and &apos;OFF&apos; treatments via </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;Scheme_ID_On_Param&quot; </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>and </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;Scheme_ID_Off_Param&quot;</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>3- You can toggle the </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;Total/Per Order&quot;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'> parameter to check </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>totals </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>or </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>per order </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>metrics. The </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>&quot;KPI Type&quot; </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>parameter allows you to display </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>absolute values </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>or </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>relative % differences </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>between the &apos;ON&apos; and &apos;OFF&apos; days</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
